Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Extract shared headless simulation and add versioned live
 client bridge

Keep the supplied archive baseline in the preceding commit. Share one client/codec with the reference frontend, expose bounded polling samples, timestamped input, command results and allocation diagnostics. M3 validation and later Unity milestones remain in progress.
